**Cautious Hag** | Unaligned Power | Limited
__Basics__
The Cautious Hag must live win with a solo team. During the night, the Cautious Hag may choose to protect a player.
__Details__
The Cautious Hag wins if they survive until the end of the game and if a solo team wins the game.
If a solo player uses a power on the Cautious Hag, the Cautious Hag learns their identity. If they attempt to kill the Cautious Hag, the attack fails.
During the night, the Cautious Hag may choose to protect a player from attacks. They may not protect the same player in consecutive nights.
Protecting a player is an immediate ability.
If the last solo role dies, the Cautious Hag turns into a solo role, becoming a bitter hag.

